-- Statutory consumption tax per market, taken from one publisher so every rule
-- carries the same provenance: PwC Worldwide Tax Summaries, standard VAT rates,
-- each territory's own last-reviewed date recorded in the citation.
-- Brazil, Canada, Ghana, Malaysia and the United States are deliberately absent:
-- their consumption taxes are multi-rate, subnational or layered with levies, so a
-- single national rate would misprice every quote. They stay 'tax not determined'.

